{"id":"1e9de82227d97578","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-trio-gsm-closure.md","title":"Trio/full trio 的 GSM 封闭性","display":"thm-trio-gsm-closure — Trio/full trio 的 GSM 封闭性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-trio-gsm-closure","aliases":["73-thm-trio-gsm-closure"],"display":"thm-trio-gsm-closure — Trio/full trio 的 GSM 封闭性","depends_on":["[[73-df-generalized-sequential-machine]]","[[73-df-trio-and-full-trio]]"],"source_id":"HU1979","source_ref":"Theorems 11.1–11.2, pp. 274–276; scans 282–284","source_status":"statement-compared-proof-outline-reviewed","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","legacy_source_id":"HU1979","legacy_source_ref":"Theorems 11.1–11.2, pp. 274–276; scans 282–284","legacy_source_status":"statement-compared-proof-outline-reviewed","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"outside-third-edition","third_edition_relation":"新版之外的拓展；保留真实旧版或独立文献来源，不归入第三版正文。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-trio-gsm-closure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-trio-gsm-closure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-trio-gsm-closure — Trio/full trio 的 GSM 封闭性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5050f3361a6cf98f\" href=\"?note=5050f3361a6cf98f\" title=\"73-df-generalized-sequential-machine\">73-df-generalized-sequential-machine</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"481adbebb0f51a94\" href=\"?note=481adbebb0f51a94\" title=\"73-df-trio-and-full-trio\">73-df-trio-and-full-trio</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"Theorems 11.1–11.2, pp. 274–276; scans 282–284"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-proof-outline-reviewed"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"Theorems 11.1–11.2, pp. 274–276; scans 282–284"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"statement-compared-proof-outline-reviewed"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"outside-third-edition"},{"key":"third_edition_relation","html":"新版之外的拓展；保留真实旧版或独立文献来源，不归入第三版正文。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathfrak L\">\\(\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathfrak L\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma,\\Delta\\in\\mathfrak A\">\\(\\Sigma,\\Delta\\in\\mathfrak A\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{GSM}_{\\Sigma,\\Delta}(M)\">\\(\\operatorname{GSM}_{\\Sigma,\\Delta}(M)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathcal F\\cap\\mathcal P(\\Sigma^*)\">\\(L\\in\\mathcal F\\cap\\mathcal P(\\Sigma^*)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\\in\\mathcal F\\cap\\mathcal P(\\Delta^*)\">\\(K\\in\\mathcal F\\cap\\mathcal P(\\Delta^*)\\)</span>。相关对象见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5050f3361a6cf98f\" href=\"?note=5050f3361a6cf98f\" title=\"73-df-generalized-sequential-machine\">73-df-generalized-sequential-machine</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"481adbebb0f51a94\" href=\"?note=481adbebb0f51a94\" title=\"73-df-trio-and-full-trio\">73-df-trio-and-full-trio</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}trio\\text{-}gsm\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{FullTrio}(\\mathcal F)\\Longrightarrow M[L]\\in\\mathcal F\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}trio\\text{-}gsm\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{FullTrio}(\\mathcal F)\\Longrightarrow M[L]\\in\\mathcal F\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}trio\\text{-}gsm\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Trio}(\\mathcal F)\\land\\operatorname{NonerasingGSM}(M)\\Longrightarrow M[L]\\in\\mathcal F\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}trio\\text{-}gsm\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Trio}(\\mathcal F)\\land\\operatorname{NonerasingGSM}(M)\\Longrightarrow M[L]\\in\\mathcal F\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}trio\\text{-}gsm\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Trio}(\\mathcal F)\\Longrightarrow M^{-1}[K]\\in\\mathcal F\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}trio\\text{-}gsm\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Trio}(\\mathcal F)\\Longrightarrow M^{-1}[K]\\in\\mathcal F\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><strong>版本归属：新版之外的拓展。</strong> 本条不作为所提供第三版 PDF 的正文陈述；原始来源以 source_id/source_ref 为准。</p>\n<p>用有限的转移字母编码一次 GSM 动作，以逆同态恢复输入、正则语言校验状态链，再同态投影输出。正则链须在初态已为终态时纳入 ε。逆 GSM 的构造还用到原书 Lemma 11.2 的有限擦除性质，不能把它未经解释地当作普通非擦除同态。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-generalized-sequential-machine","status":"resolved","id":"5050f3361a6cf98f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-generalized-sequential-machine]]","embed":fals